      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "both",
        "summary": "Isomorphic Dy4 cluster showing Dy(III) solid-state luminescence and SMM behavior. Room-temperature emission under 291 nm excitation shows Dy(III) 4F9/2 → 6H15/2 (479 nm) and 4F9/2 → 6H13/2 (574 nm) bands. χMT is 56.80 cm3 K mol−1 at 300 K and 29.08 cm3 K mol−1 at 2.0 K (1000 Oe). Zero-dc-field ac susceptibility is frequency-dependent below 15 K with QTM tails; Arrhenius analysis of χ″ peaks gives ΔE/kB = 73.6 K and τ0 = 1.94 × 10−7 s. A 2000 Oe dc field suppresses QTM and reveals additional χ″ peaks.",
